"""Script part 5: the rest of script.cpp (FRM_SetAnimationDelayed's wait in Tick, a null command, C_Script's SaveGame
and LoadGame with FindFrameForLoad, the constructor and destructor with a frame, Stop and SendSignal with the frame's
actor, NotifyFrameHit) and chunk.cpp's ReadString, against the original's.

Run: first on script/build_vm.bat, HD2_VM_QUICK=1 (the crafted programs, 3,000 random ones and the game scripts, 60
steps each, about 25 s); MUT_EXTRA_SRCS original_exe.cpp and vm_stubs.s, MUT_LDFLAGS -Wl,--image-base=0x20000000
-Wl,--wrap=_ZN8C_Script12CallFunctionEiPKiS1_; MUT_PASS "vm_diff: .*, N checks, 0 failures". The survivors then on
script/build_cmd.bat, HD2_CMD_QUICK=1 (30,000 cases, about 2,600 of them scripts made on frames, about 18 s);
MUT_EXTRA_SRCS original_exe.cpp and cmd_calls.s, MUT_LDFLAGS -Wl,--image-base=0x20000000; MUT_PASS "cmd_diff: .*, N
checks, 0 failures". Prefixes: S script.cpp, C chunk.cpp, then the line.

Result (2026-11-23): 266 mutants, 27 not building; 214 of the 239 building killed (182 by vm_diff, 26 more by
cmd_diff: the frame scripts' lines; 6 after the tests changed: the frames' releases compared after the scripts are
freed, the harness's g_noPhysicsObject not null, one-letter frame names, an empty call stack chunk, stray bytes at the
script chunk's end). Survivors:
- Equivalent: FreeArgs' delete and null (S 114, 115 del: nothing reads the arguments after); the constructor's empty
  name over a C_str already empty (S 135 del); the destructor's last store into the dying object (S 147 del); the name
  buffer a byte larger (S 705 num: the names are shorter).
- ReadString (C 117-131, 20): a script's load never reaches its 999-byte limit (C 117, 118), never gives it a negative
  size (C 119, 120: a name chunk shorter than a header, an original weakness the files avoid), a closed or writing
  chunk (C 121-123) or a failed read (C 128, 129); the names carry their own terminator, so the one written after the
  bytes read adds nothing (C 130); LoadGame ignores its result (C 131). The other suites read with it too.
"""
